WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Workspaces. Your private Personal workspace and shared team workspaces, each with its own projects and people.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: side project with a friend; agency with several clients.

3
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.780
Choose New team workspace.

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.740
Name the team…

5
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.400
…and create it. You're its owner.

6
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.240
Open it: Flow lands on its starter project, General.

7
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:22.730
Rename it in Workspace settings.

8
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:26.530
Owners can delete a team in the Danger zone, after typing its name.

9
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:32.530
Delete workspace is greyed out: Type the workspace's exact name in the confirmation box first. Only owners see the button. I can't rename Personal: That's by design: Personal is private and fixed. Its look and defaults can still be changed in Workspace settings.

10
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:37.030
A Personal workspace created on first sign-in
